# Election Watch — environment configuration
#
# You normally DON'T need to touch this file. On first run the app asks for your
# AI key IN THE BROWSER and saves it here for you (change it any time from the
# "change API key" link) — no hand-editing. This file is only for advanced or
# headless setups where you want to pre-seed the key.
#
# Required (local): at least one of ANTHROPIC_API_KEY or OPENAI_API_KEY.

# ─── Required: API key ─────────────────────────────────────────────

# Anthropic Claude (recommended)
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# OpenAI (alternative — leave blank if using Anthropic)
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# ─── Optional ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Force a specific provider. Leave commented to auto-detect from
# whichever key is set.
# AI_PROVIDER=anthropic

# Override the default model. Defaults:
#   anthropic → claude-haiku-4-5
#   openai    → gpt-5.4-mini
# MODEL=claude-opus-4-7

# Override the HTTP port (default 3000).
# PORT=3000

# ─── Facebook origin enrichment (HOSTED only — optional) ───────────
# These power Verify mode's "Track origin" auto-fill. They are server-managed:
# set them only on the box, never in a local download. With none set, origin
# tracking still works (native URL parse + heuristics + manual context).
# All use logged-off PUBLIC data — NO Facebook login / cookies are involved.

# Apify (primary enrichment): page profile, creation date, transparency.
# Token from apify.com → Settings → Integrations. ~$6/mo for ~100 pages.
# APIFY_TOKEN=
# APIFY_PAGES_ACTOR=apify~facebook-pages-scraper
# The posts scraper is used for TWO things: recent-post cadence AND resolving
# obscured /share, /reel and /watch links to the real post + author (Facebook
# now login-walls the free mbasic redirect, so this is how "Track origin"
# recovers where a shared post came from). Only runs when APIFY_TOKEN is set.
# APIFY_POSTS_ACTOR=apify~facebook-posts-scraper
# APIFY_POSTS_LIMIT=15
# ENRICH_CACHE_TTL_HOURS=24   # re-tracking the same link within this is free
# Group links get their own card (member count, created date, public/private)
# from a groups actor — the pages scraper only returns a group's name.
# APIFY_GROUPS_ACTOR=apify~facebook-groups-scraper

# Bright Data (fallback enrichment): needs a token AND a Facebook Pages dataset id.
# BRIGHTDATA_TOKEN=
# BRIGHTDATA_FB_DATASET_ID=

# Meta Ad Library API (official, free): political-ad lookup for a page.
# Token from a Meta for Developers app after ID/location confirmation.
# META_ADLIB_TOKEN=
# ADLIB_COUNTRY=ZM
# META_GRAPH_VERSION=v21.0
